lex:tapi-digital-otn-otn-oam-common
    a lex:ReferenceEntry ;
    skos:prefLabel "otn-oam-common" ;
    skos:definition "Common ODU OAM parameters.\nNote that the object is read/write or read-only depending on the context, i.e. if is part of CSEP is R/W, while if is part of CEP is read-only.\nNote that both the ODUk and ODUCn contain only one instance of ODU PM TTI overhead and ODU PM DMp overhead.\nNote that the ODUCn contains n instances of the ODU PM overhead: The OduOamCommon degThr and degM apply to the n instances of ODUCn PM OH." ;
    skos:scopeNote "Grouping definition: otn-oam-common" ;
    lex:canonicalExample "" ;
    lex:entityClass lex:GroupingKind ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/ontology/grouping/tapi-digital-otn/otn-oam-common> .

lex:tapi-digital-otn-otn-oam-mep-service-point
    a lex:ReferenceEntry ;
    skos:prefLabel "otn-oam-mep-service-point" ;
    skos:definition "Grouping definition: otn-oam-mep-service-point" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Two alternative provisioning scenarios:\n1) Oam provisioning through CSEPs for 'service' related OAM (QoS) - provisioning joint to ConnectivityService.\nIn this case the ODU MEP and MIP parameters are included (composed) in resp. ODU CEP TTP and CTP instances, i.e. no distinct ODU MEP/MIP instances.\nThis provisioning scenario could apply for:\na) NCM MEPs on terminated OTU\nb) NCM MEPs on terminated ODUCn\nc) NCM MEPs on terminated ODU/Flex\nd) NCM MEP and NCM NIM/MIP on semi-terminated ODU/Flex\ne) TCM MEPs on semi-terminated and non terminated ODU/Flex\nThe Meg related attributes are distributed also to Mep/Mip for this provisioning scenario which does not involve OtnOamService/ServicePoints.\n2) Oam provisioning through OtnOamService/ServicePoints for 'maintenance' related OAM.\nIn this case the distinct ODU MEP and MIP instances are created, referred (by name) by resp. ODU CEP TTP and CTP.\nThis provisioning scenario could apply for TCM or NIM at any segment of the Service." ;
    lex:canonicalExample "" ;
    lex:entityClass lex:GroupingKind ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/ontology/grouping/tapi-digital-otn/otn-oam-mep-service-point> .

lex:tapi-digital-otn-otn-oam-mip-service-point
    a lex:ReferenceEntry ;
    skos:prefLabel "otn-oam-mip-service-point" ;
    skos:definition "Grouping definition: otn-oam-mip-service-point" ;
    skos:scopeNote "See OtnOamMepService point comment." ;
    lex:canonicalExample "" ;
    lex:entityClass lex:GroupingKind ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/ontology/grouping/tapi-digital-otn/otn-oam-mip-service-point> .

